# ── Constitution pins: utopia-v2.nibli ───────────────────────────────────────
#
# WHAT THIS IS, and how it differs from nibli's own pins/rights-floor.nibli.
# That file guards the ENGINE MECHANISM with a deliberately self-contained
# fixture, so no edit here can weaken it. This file guards THIS CONSTITUTION'S
# CONTENT, so it must `:load` the live file — the two are complements, not
# duplicates, and both are needed.
#
# Run:  kbcheck rights-floor.pins.nibli        (prototype; see TODO.md)
# Every verdict below was produced by the engine, never by hand.

:load new-book-plans/utopia-v2.nibli
